factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the girl was lured away by Karthik and then murdered; the article says Karthik took her on a two-wheeler and the sexual assault and killing were the crime, which is consistent, but the caption states the girl was 'சிறுமியின் பக்கத்து வீட்டில் வசித்த' neighbour—this matches. However, the caption says the verdict 'இன்று மாற்றப்பட்டது' (postponed from the 16th) which is fine; no clear error there.
  The slide and caption describe the death as 'கழுத்து நெரித்துக் கொலை' (strangulation) — the article says 'கழுத்து நெரிக்கப்பட்டு' which matches, so no issue; but the article says the girl was on the 'முன்பாக' of her house and the reel_script says 'வீட்டின் முன்' which matches.
  The caption states the verdict was postponed 'இன்று மாற்றப்பட்டது' while the article says it was to be announced on the 16th and was changed to today — consistent.
  The reel_script omits the detail that the court said the verdict for the two convicts' sentencing is on 4 December only in the script, which it does include — no omission found.
  The caption says '6 மாதங்கள்' investigation and 68 witnesses — matches the article.
  The slides_spec 'loc' and category are not claims requiring checking beyond the article location; no fabricated details found.
